{
  "workflow_id": "00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000301",
  "version": 1,
  "definition": {
    "title": "Gym 003 - Reusable attack and benign verification",
    "description": "Runs fresh fixed-target exploit verification and the complete benign transaction suite. Managed by Gym 003.",
    "entrypoint": {
      "ref": "start_attack_verification",
      "expects": {
        "case_id": {"type": "str", "description": "Tracecat case UUID"},
        "scenario": {"type": "enum['supplier-intake']", "description": "Fixed server-side scenario"},
        "proposal_revision": {"type": "int", "description": "Proposal revision for correlation"},
        "mode": {"type": "enum['VERIFY_ONLY']", "description": "No configuration changes"},
        "task_id": {"type": "str", "description": "Injected case task UUID when task-launched", "default": "not-a-task"}
      }
    },
    "config": {"timeout": 210},
    "actions": [
      {
        "ref": "start_attack_verification",
        "action": "core.http_request",
        "args": {
          "url": "http://test-api:8080/v1/jobs",
          "method": "POST",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": "Bearer ${{ SECRETS.gym_003_test_api.TOKEN }}",
            "Content-Type": "application/json"
          },
          "payload": {
            "kind": "verify",
            "scenario": "supplier-intake",
            "case_id": "${{ TRIGGER.case_id }}",
            "proposal_revision": "${{ TRIGGER.proposal_revision }}"
          },
          "timeout": 10
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": "start_benign_verification",
        "action": "core.http_request",
        "args": {
          "url": "http://test-api:8080/v1/jobs",
          "method": "POST",
          "headers": {
            "Authorization": "Bearer ${{ SECRETS.gym_003_test_api.TOKEN }}",
            "Content-Type": "application/json"
          },
          "payload": {
            "kind": "benign",
            "scenario": "supplier-intake",
            "case_id": "${{ TRIGGER.case_id }}",
            "proposal_revision": "${{ TRIGGER.proposal_revision }}"
          },
          "timeout": 10
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": "wait_for_attack_verification",
        "action": "core.http_poll",
        "depends_on": ["start_attack_verification"],
        "args": {
          "url": "http://test-api:8080/v1/jobs/${{ ACTIONS.start_attack_verification.result.data.run_id }}",
          "method": "GET",
          "headers": {"Authorization": "Bearer ${{ SECRETS.gym_003_test_api.TOKEN }}"},
          "timeout": 10,
          "poll_interval": 2,
          "poll_max_attempts": 90,
          "poll_condition": "lambda response: response['data'].get('status') in ['completed', 'inconclusive', 'failed', 'cancelled', 'timed_out']"
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": "wait_for_benign_verification",
        "action": "core.http_poll",
        "depends_on": ["start_benign_verification"],
        "args": {
          "url": "http://test-api:8080/v1/jobs/${{ ACTIONS.start_benign_verification.result.data.run_id }}",
          "method": "GET",
          "headers": {"Authorization": "Bearer ${{ SECRETS.gym_003_test_api.TOKEN }}"},
          "timeout": 10,
          "poll_interval": 2,
          "poll_max_attempts": 90,
          "poll_condition": "lambda response: response['data'].get('status') in ['completed', 'inconclusive', 'failed', 'cancelled', 'timed_out']"
        }
      },
      {
        "ref": "record_verification",
        "action": "core.cases.create_comment",
        "depends_on": ["wait_for_attack_verification", "wait_for_benign_verification"],
        "args": {
          "case_id": "${{ TRIGGER.case_id }}",
          "content": "## Gym 003 verification\n\n- Task: `${{ TRIGGER.task_id }}`\n- Execution: `${{ ENV.workflow.execution_id }}`\n- Before/after verdict: `${{ ACTIONS.wait_for_attack_verification.result.data.verdict }}` (verification made no rule change)\n\n### Benign tests\n```json\n${{ FN.prettify_json(ACTIONS.wait_for_benign_verification.result.data.benign) }}\n```\n\n### WAF events\n```json\n${{ FN.prettify_json(ACTIONS.wait_for_attack_verification.result.data.waf_events) }}\n```\n\n### Evidence and cleanup\n```json\n${{ FN.prettify_json({'attack_evidence': ACTIONS.wait_for_attack_verification.result.data.evidence, 'benign_evidence': ACTIONS.wait_for_benign_verification.result.data.evidence, 'cleanup': ACTIONS.wait_for_attack_verification.result.data.cleanup}) }}\n```"
        }
      }
    ],
    "returns": "${{ {'attack': ACTIONS.wait_for_attack_verification.result.data, 'benign': ACTIONS.wait_for_benign_verification.result.data, 'execution_id': ENV.workflow.execution_id} }}"
  }
}
